ock.pstatic.net/stock-research/market/18/20261106_market_369972000.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#0759a6;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px;font-weight:700;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-size:14px\">[리포트 원문]</a></div></div></section>\n<section data-section=\"korea-stocks\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin:26px 0 0\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;border-bottom:2px solid #0b2545;padding-bottom:7px;margin:0 0 12px\"><h2 style=\"margin:0;font-size:clamp(19px,4.8vw,22px);line-height:1.35;font-weight:900;color:#0b2545;word-break:keep-all\">업종과 종목: 투자자 검색 상위</h2><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.03em;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:3px;white-space:nowrap;background:#e8eef6;color:#0b2545\">데이터</span></div><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#566476;font-size:15px\">네이버페이 증권 검색 상위 종목(ETF·ETN·레버리지 제외)의 전일 종가 기준 등락과 최근 증권사 리포트다. 검색 순위는 관심도 지표이며 주가 변동의 원인이 아니다.</p><div data-visualization=\"change-bars\" style=\"border:1px solid #dbe2ea;padding:10px 10px 4px;margin:0 0 12px\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 152\" width=\"100%\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%\" role=\"img\"><line x1=\"244\" x2=\"244\" y1=\"2\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#9aa6b2\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><text x=\"122\" y=\"19\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#16202e\">삼성전자</text><rect x=\"214.8\" y=\"8\" width=\"29.2\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#1f5fbf\"></rect><text x=\"210.8\" y=\"19\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1f5fbf\">-3.97%</text><text x=\"122\" y=\"43\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#16202e\">SK하이닉스</text><rect x=\"192.8\" y=\"32\" width=\"51.2\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#1f5fbf\"></rect><text x=\"188.8\" y=\"43\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1f5fbf\">-6.96%</text><text x=\"122\" y=\"67\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#16202e\">NAVER</text><rect x=\"244.0\" y=\"56\" width=\"14.7\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#c62828\"></rect><text x=\"262.7\" y=\"67\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#c62828\">+2.00%</text><text x=\"122\" y=\"91\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#16202e\">삼성전기</text><rect x=\"205.0\" y=\"80\" width=\"39.0\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#1f5fbf\"></rect><text x=\"201.0\" y=\"91\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1f5fbf\">-5.30%</text><text x=\"122\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#16202e\">현대차</text><rect x=\"212.6\" y=\"104\" width=\"31.4\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#1f5fbf\"></rect><text x=\"208.6\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1f5fbf\">-4.26%</text><text x=\"122\" y=\"139\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#16202e\">두산에너빌리티</text><rect x=\"182.0\" y=\"128\" width=\"62.0\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#1f5fbf\"></rect><text x=\"178.0\" y=\"139\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1f5fbf\">-8.42%</text></svg></div><p style=\"margin:0 0 13px\">검색 1위 삼성전자는 <b style=\"color:#16202e;font-weight:800;white-space:nowrap\">193,500원</b>으로 <b style=\"color:#1f5fbf;font-weight:800;white-space:nowrap\">3.97%</b> 하락했다.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 13px\">검색 2위 SK하이닉스는 <b style=\"color:#16202e;font-weight:800;white-space:nowrap\">1,176,000원</b>으로 <b style=\"color:#1f5fbf;font-weight:800;white-space:nowrap\">6.96%</b> 급락했다.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 13px\">검색 3위 NAVER는 <b style=\"color:#16202e;font-weight:800;white-space:nowrap\">188,600원</b>으로 <b style=\"color:#c62828;font-weight:800;white-space:nowrap\">2.00%</b> 상승했다.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 13px\">검색 4위 삼성전기는 <b style=\"color:#16202e;font-weight:800;white-space:nowrap\">894,000원</b>으로 <b style=\"color:#1f5fbf;font-weight:800;white-space:nowrap\">5.30%</b> 급락했다.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 13px\">검색 5위 현대차는 <b style=\"color:#16202e;font-weight:800;white-space:nowrap\">281,000원</b>으로 <b style=\"color:#1f5fbf;font-weight:800;white-space:nowrap\">4.26%</b> 하락했다. 유진투자증권은 11월 6일 「NDR 후기: 로보틱스에서 본업으로 초점 이동」 리포트에서 관련 분석을 내놨다. <a href=\"https://stock.pstatic.net/stock-research/company/63/20261106_company_508693000.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#0759a6;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px;font-weight:700;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-size:14px\">[리포트 원문]</a></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 13px\">검색 6위 두산에너빌리티는 <b style=\"color:#16202e;font-weight:800;white-space:nowrap\">45,150원</b>으로 <b style=\"color:#1f5fbf;font-weight:800;white-space:nowrap\">8.42%</b> 급락했다.</p></section>\n<section data-section=\"korea-indexes\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin:26px 0 0\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;border-bottom:2px solid #0b2545;padding-bottom:7px;margin:0 0 12px\"><h2 style=\"margin:0;font-size:clamp(19px,4.8vw,22px);line-height:1.35;font-weight:900;color:#0b2545;word-break:keep-all\">코스피·코스닥·환율</h2><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.03em;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:3px;white-space:nowrap;background:#e8eef6;color:#0b2545\">데이터</span></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,150px),1fr));gap:8px;margin:0 0 12px\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #dbe2ea;padding:9px 11px;min-width:0\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#566476;word-break:keep-all\">KOSPI</div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#16202e;white-space:nowrap\">5,059.69</div><div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:800;color:#1f5fbf;white-space:nowrap\">-6.02%</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #dbe2ea;padding:9px 11px;min-width:0\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#566476;word-break:keep-all\">KOSDAQ</div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#16202e;white-space:nowrap\">644.27</div><div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:800;color:#1f5fbf;white-space:nowrap\">-5.03%</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #